These information like the name of the customer, address of the customer, gender of the customer,
from what date they are customer on Amazon, what purchases they have made in the last three months, one month, six months, one year,

5703
06:10:52,510 --> 06:10:54,230
什么，以及他们掌握的其他关于这些客户的信息。
These information like the name of the customer, address of the customer, gender of the customer,
from what date they are customer on Amazon, what purchases they have made in the last three months, one month, six months, one year,

5704
06:10:54,230 --> 06:10:57,452
什么，以及他们掌握的其他关于这些客户的信息。
and other things they know about uh these customer.

5705
