If I consider third factor, four factors, fifth factor, then the quality of the
groups will become better and better if I take more and more of these factors.

5784
06:17:01,646 --> 06:17:03,876
但我选择的因素必须是好的。
But the factors which I take should be good.

5785
06:17:04,462 --> 06:17:05,796
我说的“好”是什么意思呢？
And what do I mean by that?

5786
06:17:06,318 --> 06:17:07,876
让我用一个例子给你们展示一下。
Let me show you that with an example.

5787
06:17:08,494 --> 06:17:10,116
它们必须具有差异性。
They have to be dissimilar.

5788
06:17:10,542 --> 06:17:13,668
第一组和第二组在某些方面必须是不相似的。
First group and second group have to be dissimilar in some way.

5789
06:17:14,094 --> 06:17:15,716
它们在某些方面必须是不相似的。
Some way they have to be dissimilar.

5790
06:17:16,014 --> 06:17:20,388
所以这两组都是年轻人，但这一组是高消费群体，那一组是低消费群体。
So these both are young people, but these are high spenders and these are low spenders.

5791
06:17:20,814 --> 06:17:22,960
这就让他们区别开来了，对吧？
So that makes them different, right?

5792
06:17:23,360 --> 06:17:25,444
这就是让他们产生区分的原因。
That is what that makes them separate.

5793
06:17:25,902 --> 06:17:31,140
所以这一组中的一个数据点和另一组中的一个数据点彼此之间应该非常不相似。
So one data point from this group and one data point from this group should be very dissimilar from each other.

5794
06:17:31,406 --> 06:17:32,932
这就是我们想要确保的目标。
That is what we are trying to make sure.

5795
06:17:33,486 --> 06:17:39,140
所以让我们看看，哪些因素更适合用来创建聚类。
So let us see that what could be the factors which are better for making the clusters.

5796
06:17:39,854 --> 06:17:41,476
好，让我们来看看。
