07:52:25,230 --> 07:52:29,764
所以我们讨论了 K-means 算法的两个主要缺陷。
So there are two major flaws of K-Mains algorithm that were discussed.

7036
07:52:29,936 --> 07:52:34,692
第一，我们必须预先定义一个 K 值，并将其提供给算法。
One, we have to predefine a K-value, which we have to provide to the algorithm.

7037
07:52:35,150 --> 07:52:42,404
第二，当我们使用 K-means 算法时，我们只有制作球形聚类的选项。
Second, we have the option of only making spherical clusters when using the K-Mains algorithm.

7038
07:52:42,670 --> 07:52:47,396
球形意味着如果你使用 K-means，你可以做出圆形形状的聚类。
Spherical means you can make a circular shape of clusters if you use the K-means.

7039
07:52:48,046 --> 07:52:59,044
所以如果你的数据集里有其他形状的聚类，比如菱形、正方形或者任何其他形状，
那么 k-means 就不适合用来识别那种形状的聚类了。
So if your data set has any other shape of cluster, like a diamond shape or square shape or any other shape,
then k-means is not suitable to identify that shape of cluster.

7040
07:52:59,694 --> 07:53:00,016
对吧。
Right.

7041
07:53:00,302 --> 07:53:08,356
所以正是考虑到这两个缺陷或局限性，层次聚类方法才被创建出来。
So that is where keeping these two flaws or limitations in mind, the hierarchical clustering approach was created.

7042
07:53:08,622 --> 07:53:08,896
好的。
Okay.

7043
07:53:09,198 --> 07:53:16,096
所以这是另一种算法，当 k-means 无法给我们理想结果时，就可以使用它。
So it's another algorithm which is to be used when k-means is not giving us the desired results.

7044
07:53:16,256 --> 07:53:20,996
现在要实现层次聚类，我们有两种方法，两种途径。
Now to implement the hierarchical clustering, there are two methods, two approaches that we have.

7045
07:53:21,326 --> 07:53:23,780
一种是凝聚式，一种是分裂式。
One is agglomerative and one is divisive.

7046
07:53:24,176 --> 07:53:37,056
在凝聚式和分裂式中，你可以看到凝聚式是以某种方式运作的，就是你选取多个数据点，
然后把这些数据点合并在一起形成聚类，对吧？
In agglomerative and divisive, you see that agglomerative works in a certain way that you take multiple data points and those data
points are combined together to make clusters, right?

7047
07:53:37,422 --> 07:53:38,416
凝聚式就是这样的。
Agglomerative is this.

7048
07:53:38,606 --> 07:53:45,668
凝聚式说，你从单个的数据点开始，直到你形成越来越大的聚类。
Agglomerative says that you start with single, single data point till you make bigger and bigger and bigger clusters.

7049
07:53:46,030 --> 07:53:51,684
最后，你应该拥有一个包含所有小聚类的巨大聚类。
And at the end, you should be having one big cluster where all the small, small clusters are there.

7050
07:53:52,016 --> 07:53:52,388
对吧。
Right.

7051
07:53:52,816 --> 07:53:54,052
这就是你应该得到的。
That is what you should have.

7052
07:53:54,446 --> 07:54:00,896
而完全相反的操作，你可以在分裂式聚类中实现。
The exact opposite of that you will do, you will be able to uh do with uh do that with divisive clustering.

7053
07:54:01,056 --> 07:54:04,976
所以分裂式就是从最后到最初的完全相反。
So divisive is exact opposite from the last to the first.

7054
07:54:05,136 --> 07:54:08,736
如果你按照那个过程去做，你就能完成分裂式，对吧？
If you do that process, then you will be able to do the divisive, right?

7055
07:54:08,816 --> 07:54:13,536
所以你要做凝聚式的完全相反，分裂式就会被执行。
So exact opposite of agglomerative, you have to do, and divisive will be performed.

7056
