这是唯一被使用的，而且它更容易理解，也更容易直观地解释发生了什么。
This is uh the only one which is used, and this is more easy to understand, intuitive to explain also what is happening.

7059
07:54:31,054 --> 07:54:33,124
所以使用的是凝聚式。
So that is agglomerative one is used.

7060
07:54:33,296 --> 07:54:33,696
对。
Right.

7061
07:54:33,998 --> 07:54:36,416
所以凝聚式说了什么，理解这一点。
So what agglomerative says, understand this thing.

7062
07:54:36,576 --> 07:54:41,412
凝聚式说我们必须从单个数据点开始，对吧？
Agglomerative says that we have to start with single data points, right?

7063
07:54:41,696 --> 07:54:49,060
凝聚式说在开始时，你拥有的所有数据点本身就是一个聚类，所有的数据点都是。
Agglomerative says that in the start, all the data points that you have they are a cluster in themselves, all the data points.

7064
07:54:49,376 --> 07:54:52,976
现在，到这一步，你正在做什么？
Now, at this point, what are you doing now?

7065
07:54:53,056 --> 07:54:56,612
你发现 1 和 2 最接近，你把它们放入一个聚类中。
You found out that one and two are closest, you put them into one cluster.

7066
07:54:56,976 --> 07:55:00,356
然后你发现 3 和 4 最接近，你把它们放入一个聚类中。
Then you found three and four are closest, you put them into one cluster.

7067
07:55:00,846 --> 07:55:03,684
然后 5 和 6 最接近，你把它们放入一个聚类中。
Then five and six were closest, you put them in one cluster.

7068
07:55:04,096 --> 07:55:09,616
然后你把它们放入一个聚类，接着再把它们放入一个聚类，对吧？
Then you put them into one cluster, and then you put them into one cluster, right?

7069
07:55:09,936 --> 07:55:17,936
所以这种方法是先从单个数据点开始，最后把所有东西都放到一个大聚类里。
So this approach where you are starting with single single data points,
and at the end you are putting everything into one big cluster.

7070
07:55:18,016 --> 07:55:20,256
这被称为凝聚式，对吧？
This is known as agglomerative, right?

