8484
09:28:15,184 --> 09:28:19,524
接着如果我再看房龄，我就拿到了第四个输入列。
Then if I go and if I see age, I take the fourth input column.

8485
09:28:20,064 --> 09:28:27,744
所以房龄……如果我现在拿四个输入列，它会帮助我们更准确地预测房屋的价格。
So age will be uh if if I take four input columns now, it will be helping us to predict the price of the house even better.

8486
09:28:28,046 --> 09:28:28,384
没错。
Correct.

8487
09:28:28,558 --> 09:28:42,304
所以我现在想解释给你们听的是，看这里，如果我有四个输入列，那么这四个输入列相比于一个、
两个或三个输入列，能更好地预测房屋的价格。
So what I'm trying to explain to you is now see here, if I have four input columns, so for four input columns,
will be predicting the price of the house much better compared to one input column or two input column or three input column.

8488
09:28:42,384 --> 09:28:42,864
没错。
Correct.

8489
09:28:43,104 --> 09:28:55,664
所以这个思路是，当我拥有越来越多的输入列时，随着我们增加输入列，
预测输出的准确率也会随之提高，对吧？
So the idea is that when I have more and more input column, so our accuracy
of predicting the output increases as much as we take the input column, right?

8490
09:28:55,744 --> 09:29:04,384
随着我增加越来越多的输入列，我们的准确率或者机器学习模型的性能就会不断提高。
We we go on increasing our accuracy or the performance of our ML model improves as I take more and more input column.

8491
09:29:04,992 --> 09:29:07,748
但如果你这样做，就会出现一个问题。
But there's a problem that happens if you do that.

8492
09:29:07,982 --> 09:29:11,428
那个问题被称为「维度灾难」。
And that problem is called as curse of dimensionality.

8493
09:29:11,758 --> 09:29:15,152
好，那个问题被称为维度灾难。
Okay, that problem is known as curse of dimensionality.

8494
09:29:15,312 --> 09:29:17,028
什么是维度灾难？
What is this curse of dimensionality?

8495
09:29:17,294 --> 09:29:17,552
没错。
Correct.

8496
09:29:17,712 --> 09:29:19,588
看，什么是维度灾难？
See, what is this curse of dimensionality?

8497
09:29:19,982 --> 09:29:23,524
维度灾难的意思是，各位，请注意这里。
Curse of dimensionality says that, everyone, please focus here.

8498
09:29:23,712 --> 09:29:24,672
呃，非常重要。
Uh, very important.

8499
09:29:25,006 --> 09:29:33,764
维度灾难的意思是，当你增加输入列的数量时，与此同时，模型的准确率也会提高。
Curse of dimensionality says that when you increase the number of
input column, so along with that, accuracy of your model also improves.

8500
09:29:34,032 --> 09:29:40,164
如果你再次增加输入列，模型的准确率还会继续提高。
If you increase your input column again, so accuracy of your model will improve again.

8501
09:29:40,672 --> 09:29:43,587
所以你正在增加输入列的数量。
So you are increasing the number of input column.

8502
09:29:43,886 --> 09:29:47,204
与此同时，你的模型准确率也在提高。
and with that, the accuracy of your model is also improving.

8503
09:29:47,792 --> 09:29:54,672
但是到了某个点之后，如果你继续增加输入列，你会看到什么？
But there comes a certain point after which, if you increase the input column more, then what will you see?

8504
09:29:54,832 --> 09:30:01,924
你会看到随着输入列数量的增加，你的准确率是在下降，而不是在上升。
You will see that your accuracy is decreasing, not increasing with that, with the increase in number of input column.

8505
09:30:02,352 --> 09:30:03,908
那原因是什么呢？
But what is the reason for that?

8506
09:30:04,206 --> 09:30:11,312
所以维度灾难的意思是，呃，你确实应该增加更多的输入列，但只能到一定程度。
So the curse of dimensionality says that uh you should be definitely taking more and more input column, but till a certain point.

8507
09:30:11,502 --> 09:30:15,716
你不应该盲目地一直增加更多的输入列。
You should not just keep taking more and more input column uh blindly.

8508
09:30:15,982 --> 09:30:24,516
你只需要选取那些对你真正重要的输入列，或者说，你应该收集到一定数量的输入列为止。
You just take the input columns which are actually important for you, or till a certain amount,
you should collect a number of input columns.

8509
09:30:24,782 --> 09:30:29,924
但在那之后，你不应该再增加输入列了，因为这会对你的模型有害。
But after that, you should not take more and more input columns because it will be harmful for your model.

8510
09:30:30,192 --> 09:30:30,852
但为什么呢？
But why?

8511
09:30:31,310 --> 09:30:35,780
为了理解这一点，我们来看看导致这种情况的一个简单原因。
To understand that, we'll see a simple reason why this happens.

8512
09:30:36,014 --> 09:30:40,832
为什么在达到一定点之后，如果我继续增加输入列，准确率反而会下降？
Why, after a certain point, if I increase the input column more, the accuracy decreases.

8513
09:30:40,992 --> 09:30:42,084
原因是什么呢？
What is the reason for that?

8514
09:30:42,286 --> 09:30:48,292
假设我在一个数据集中选取了五个输入列，并用它们来构建模型。
Let's say if I have five input columns I have taken in a data set and I'm making a model with that.

8515
09:30:48,622 --> 09:30:50,724
我只是在处理这五个输入列。
I am just working with five input columns.

8516
09:30:51,392 --> 09:31:00,292
既然我只处理五个输入列，那肯定是我收集了五个重要的输入列，因为输入列的数量非常少。
since I'm working with five input columns, so definitely I would have collected
five important input columns because the number of input columns are very less.

8517
09:31:00,622 --> 09:31:08,612
所以，无论我从哪儿收集这些输入列，这五个输入列都是重要的，一共五个输入列。
So, whatever input column I have, I would have collected from somewhere,
that all the five input columns would be important, five input columns.

8518
09:31:09,232 --> 09:31:12,292
现在假设我把它增加到10个输入列。
Now let's say I increase it to 10 input columns.

8519
09:31:12,654 --> 09:31:26,512
那么这10个输入列也是如此，如果我增加输入列，这10个输入
列也是我会非常谨慎挑选出来的，而且这10个输入列都很重要。
So 10 input columns are also such that if I'm increasing the input column, 10 input columns are also the number of columns that I
would have been very careful, and these 10 input columns are important.

8520
09:31:26,926 --> 09:31:29,668
这10个输入列里的所有列都是重要的。
All the columns would be important in this 10 input columns.

8521
09:31:30,158 --> 09:31:37,060
但假设我现在继续收集越来越多的输入列，现在我有50列，也就是50个输入列。
But let's say I now kept collecting more and more input columns, and now I have 50 columns, 50 input columns.

8522
09:31:37,552 --> 09:31:44,592
那么在这些列里，会不会有一些是不重要的列？
So will there be chances of some unimportant columns that I would have collected in this?

8523
09:31:45,614 --> 09:31:50,427
因为我一直在收集越来越多的输入列，现在我有50个输入列了。
Since I'm collecting more and more and more input column, and now I have 50 input column.

8524
09:31:50,926 --> 09:32:01,380
所以有没有可能，如果我取50个输入列，其中会包含一两个没用的列，
因为我当时只是专注于收集更多的列。
So is there chances that if I'm taking 50 input columns, so I would have collected one or
two unnecessary columns because I was just focused on collecting more and more columns.

8525
09:32:01,774 --> 09:32:09,232
所以肯定可能会发生这种情况，如果我取50个输入列，其中一些列可能是不重要的，对吧？
So it can definitely happen that if I'm taking 50 input columns, some of my columns would be unimportant, possible, right?

8526
09:32:09,312 --> 09:32:12,932
我不是说这种情况一定会发生，但可能性非常高。
I'm not saying that it will always happen, but the possibility is very high.

8527
09:32:13,712 --> 09:32:17,444
同样地，假设我增加到100列。
Same way, if I let's say go to 100 columns.

8528
09:32:17,806 --> 09:32:30,244
如果我增加到100列，那么如果我谈论100个输入列，在这种情况下，
包含大量没用列的可能性会更高。
If I go to 100 columns, so now the chances of taking more, if if I'm talking about 100 input columns,
so the chances of lot of unnecessary columns will be even higher in this case.

8529
09:32:30,832 --> 09:32:36,292
这就是导致维度灾难的情况。
So this is the situation which causes the curse of dimensionality.

8530
09:32:36,590 --> 09:32:42,660
维度灾难是指，到一定程度为止，你收集的都是好的输入列。
The curse of dimensionality says that till a certain point you would be collecting good input columns.

8531
09:32:43,054 --> 09:32:43,312
没错。
Correct.

8532
09:32:43,472 --> 09:32:48,388
到一定程度，到一定数量的列为止，你收集的都是好的输入列。
Till a certain point, till a certain number of columns, you would be collecting good input columns.

8533
09:32:48,832 --> 09:32:57,284
但过了那个点，因为你一心只想收集更多的输入列，所以你最终会收集到一些没用的列。
But after that point, since you are focused on collecting more and more input columns somehow,
